It is test data only: glia's CLI decodes the SCIP wire format by hand
(cli/src/cmd/inputs/scip/wire.rs) and never compiles this schema. The file is
here so `protoc --encode=scip.Index scip.proto` can re-encode the *.textproto
fixtures beside it, an encoder independent of glia's decoder. glia's own
